     "explanation": "This is Joule's experiment in a teacup. With **Q = 0** and **W = 500 J** done on the water, ΔU = Q + W = 0 + 500 = **+500 J**. Internal energy is internal energy no matter which door it comes through — the molecules can't tell stirring from heating. More internal energy means faster-jiggling molecules, which means a higher temperature. Work and heat are the same currency.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">STIRRING = HEATING</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Apply ΔU = Q + W to a whisked cup</text><rect x=\"350\" y=\"200\" width=\"400\" height=\"360\" rx=\"24\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">INSULATED WATER</text><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"280\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"440\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M550 440 q-50 30 -80 0\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"10\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M550 440 q50 30 80 0\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"10\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"470\" cy=\"490\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><circle cx=\"630\" cy=\"480\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><circle cx=\"550\" cy=\"510\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">whisk does 500 J of work</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"690\" width=\"360\" height=\"130\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"745\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">Q = 0</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">no heat flows in</text><rect x=\"620\" y=\"690\" width=\"360\" height=\"130\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"745\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">W = 500 J</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">work done on water</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"860\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.2)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"935\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">ΔU = 0 + 500 = +500 J</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Q = 0, W = 500 J, so ΔU = +500 J. Stirring raises internal energy exactly as heating would."
     }
